WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:07.375
The Parliamentary Budget Officer calculated that MAID saves the government 149 million dollars per year.

00:00:07.325 --> 00:00:11.387
They calculated this BEFORE Parliament voted to expand it.

00:00:11.387 --> 00:00:17.237
Projected savings: 1.273 trillion dollars by 2047.

00:00:17.237 --> 00:00:20.175
MAID is not just a medical program.

00:00:20.175 --> 00:00:23.662
It is fiscal policy disguised as compassion.
